        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana CF450, Solid Brass Contemporary Window Lock</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Contemporary styled window locks is easy to install. Not only is it better for security, but a good sealing window can help lower energy costs. Replace your old worn and painted locks with these solid brass ones for an all new contemporary look. Deltana is an architectural hardware manufacturer famous for solid brass hardware with a proven record for exceptional quality. The Solid Brass Contemporary Window Lock Casement Fastener has a reversible lever handle and comes supplied with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-CF450-specifications.gif?v=1704354635\" width=\"521\" height=\"229\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana CF450 Contemporary Window Lock Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana CF450 Contemporary Window Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lock Handle Length: 3-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Handle Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Box Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Reversible for left and right hand applications.</li>\r\n<li>Includes matching finish screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CF450.pdf?v=1691095270\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana CF450 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass Contemporary Window Lock Casement Fastener | Deltana CF450",
                "description": "Solid Brass Contemporary Window Lock Deltana CF450 - The Contemporary styled window locks is easy to install. Not only is it better for security, but a good sealing window can help lower energy costs. Replace your old worn and painted locks with these solid brass ones for an all new contemporary look. Deltana is an architectural hardware manufacturer famous for solid brass hardware with a proven record for exceptional quality. The Solid Brass Contemporary Window Lock Casement Fastener has a reversible lever handle and comes supplied with mounting hardware. Available in 8 finish colors. \r\n",
                "keywords": "DEL-CF450 Contemporary Window Locks, deltana CF450 window lock casement fasteners, window hardware, Solid Brass Contemporary Window Lock Casement Fasteners, deltana lever handle window locks, DEL-CF450U3, DEL-CF450U5, DEL-CF450U10B, DEL-CF450U15, DEL-CF450U15A, DEL-CF450U19, DEL-CF450U26, DEL-CF450U26D"
